  "notes": "A formal word used in organizational, military, and scientific contexts. In biology, {神経|しんけい}{伝達|でんたつ} refers to nerve signal transmission. In organizations, it emphasizes the systematic passing of information down a chain.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {情報|じょうほう}{伝達|でんたつ} (information transmission)\n- {命令|めいれい}{伝達|でんたつ} (transmission of orders)\n- {神経|しんけい}{伝達|でんたつ} (nerve transmission)\n- {伝達|でんたつ}{事項|じこう} (matters to be communicated)\n- {伝達|でんたつ}{手段|しゅだん} (means of communication)",
